+              <p>Breathable layers with a relaxed drape and elevated neutral palette.</p>
+              <button class="add">Add to cart</button>
+            </div>
+          </article>
+          <article class="product" data-category="living">
+            <div class="image">🪞</div>
+            <div class="content">
