+            <div class="image">✦</div>
+            <div class="content">
+              <time datetime="2026-05-05">May 5, 2026</time>
+              <h3>How to layer texture without clutter</h3>
+              <p>Balance soft neutrals, natural materials, and one bold focal point for an edited look.</p>
+            </div>
+          </article>
+          <article class="story">
+            <div class="image">◌</div>
+            <div class="content">
+              <time datetime="2026-05-03">May 3, 2026</time>
+              <h3>Five pieces that refresh a room instantly</h3>
+              <p>Small swaps that make a visible difference: lighting, textiles, trays, mirrors, and scent.</p>
+            </div>
+          </article>
+          <article class="story">
+            <div class="image">△</div>
+            <div class="content">
+              <time datetime="2026-05-01">May 1, 2026</time>
+              <h3>Designing a calmer everyday routine</h3>
+              <p>Editorial picks that bring order and warmth to entryways, work nooks, and bedrooms.</p>
